id: pm-rbg1qo
title: "Session-topic provenance has no descriptor keys on any harness, and effort/role are wired for only claude-code and codex, so most fleet history records harness and model but nothing about the work's shape"
description: "The extensible provenance schema (ADR pm-oskdmu, shipped via pm-itsjf0) supports arbitrary dimensions, but the built-in descriptor table in src/core/shared/author.ts declares effort only for claude-code (CLAUDE_EFFORT) and codex (CODEX_REASONING_EFFORT/CODEX_EFFORT), role only for codex (CODEX_SESSION_ROLE), and topic for none of the seven agent harnesses (claude-code, codex, pi, opencode, cursor, aider, gemini-cli). Maintainers explicitly want attribution that includes the session topic and thinking level without any agent typing an identity flag. Each harness that exposes a topic/subject or effort signal needs its env keys declared; harnesses that expose none get an explicit null-mapping note so the gap is a documented harness limitation rather than an undiscovered omission."
type: Issue
status: open
priority: 2
tags[5]: agent-ux,attribution,identity,observability,provenance
created_at: "2026-07-27T07:07:26.295Z"
updated_at: "2026-07-27T07:07:48.672Z"
author: "harness:opencode"
acceptance_criteria: "Every built-in agent descriptor either declares keys for topic, effort and role or carries a recorded no-signal note for the missing dimension; detection tests prove each declared key flows into history provenance; fleet attribution (pm-gw6uyq) can group recorded history by topic and effort for the harnesses that expose them; no agent is ever required to set PM_AUTHOR or an identity flag"
goal: project management = context management
objective: "Attribution rich enough that per-harness, per-model, per-effort and per-topic fleet analytics (pm-gw6uyq) run on recorded history alone"
why_now: "Maintainer directive: harness, model, thinking level and session topic must all be auto-detected; the schema shipped extensible but the built-in descriptor table only covers two harnesses for effort and one for role"
parent: pm-5oj5
